9. **rule 4: overlap clearly or leave a clear gap.** lantern and man 5 almost touch: 4 pixels apart. Edges that just meet make near and far things look stuck together (a clear overlap is at least 15 pixels deep; a clear gap at least 18). (at 0.24 across, 0.60 down; lantern is nearer the camera)
