17. **rule 4: overlap clearly or leave a clear gap.** man 5's edge runs right along diesel drum's edge for 35 pixels, without clearly passing behind it. Edges that just meet make near and far things look stuck together. (from 0.64 to 0.65 down, around 0.33 across; diesel drum is nearer the camera)
